    "&lt;p&gt;A post-installation report shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, detailing compliance with the development&#x27;s projected sound levels as per the noise impact assessment dated 02 January 2025. The approved detail shall thereafter be maintained for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing number HR-1403-PFPE dated 17th December 2024.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development shall fully conform with the recommendations of the noise impact assessment dated 02 January 2025. The development shall be carried in accordance with the approved details for noise mitigation measures and shall thereafter be maintained for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The materials to be used for the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those of the existing building and shall thereafter be retained as such for the lifetime of the development."
